                                "example_id": "b9ebba02-7597-43fd-8b72-bccabce1d280",
                                "sense_id": "844cad55-27f9-339e-8944-a9da4679b489",
                                "text": "At the sight of Bradly up there, staring down at her, she seemed to get the shock of an unprecedented intrusion on her privacy too, and remained gaping up at him, brush in one hand and paint-pot in the other."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04810d7c-9876-4596-9df6-db2833049741",
                                "sense_id": "844cad55-27f9-339e-8944-a9da4679b489",
                                "text": "A fifth man is busied with paintpot and brush. He is kneeling on the ground, painting a strip of canvas […]"
